# Bundled AI-tool assets. OpenSpec and UI/UX Pro Max ship their skills, templates and
# reference data inside the project, which adds thousands of files that are third-party
# data rather than this project's source. Indexing them would fill the knowledge graph
# with nodes about font catalogues and icon lists instead of the editor itself.
.agents/
.claude/

# The openspec/ directory holds the spec-driven workflow's own scaffolding plus the
# generated specs. The specs are worth indexing; the scaffolding is not.
openspec/changes/archive/

# Local runtime data (also in .gitignore, listed here for the indexer).
backups/
config/services.yaml
config/bookmarks.yaml
shots/
